+### Ad performance overview
+
+The ad performance overview displays summary metric cards at the top of the dashboard, organized into two collapsible groups:
+
+- **Ad platforms** – Metrics reported by your connected ad platforms, such as impressions, clicks, cost, and CTR
+- **PostHog** – Your configured conversion goals and cost per conversion
+
+Each group shows how many metrics are currently visible out of the total available.
+
+#### Configure metrics
+
+Click **Configure metrics** to customize which metrics appear in the overview. In the configuration modal, you can:
+
+- **Show or hide individual metrics** using the checkbox next to each metric name
+- **Show or hide entire groups** using the **Show all** and **Hide all** buttons for each section
+- **Reorder metrics** within each group using the up and down arrow buttons
+- **Reset to defaults** to restore the original visibility and order
+
+Click **Apply** to save your changes or **Cancel** to discard them. Configuring overview metrics does not affect table columns or the underlying queries.
+
+#### Collapse groups
+
+Click the group name (**Ad platforms** or **PostHog**) to collapse or expand that section. Collapsing a group hides the cards temporarily without removing them from your configuration.
+
+Visibility, order, and collapsed state are saved per project in your browser and persist across page reloads.
+
